     "text": "QF contributes to building healthier, more inclusive, and resilient communities by ensuring that advances in precision health benefit diverse populations and address national priorities. Through public health awareness, genomics education, child protection initiatives, autism advocacy, bioethics leadership, and global partnerships, QF is fostering a culture of wellbeing, inclusion, and shared responsibility for health."
